e + N2 -> N + N + e (dissociation into neutrals, channel-summed). Cross section: Song et al., J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 52, 023104 (2023), Table 9 (Cosby 1993 recommended set, +-20 %), transcribed. sigma = 0 below 12 eV; held at the 200 eV value above 200 eV (tail sensitivity: 0.00 % at 15 eV, 0.06 % at 30 eV, 0.95 % at 45 eV, 3.75 % at 60 eV, 14.05 % at 90 eV, 37.75 % at 150 eV, 71.24 % at 300 eV). Header energy 12.14 eV = N(2D)+N(4S) threshold (dominant channel, Cosby 1993). Maxwellian-integrated by abep_sim/rate_tables.py (scripts/build_n2_dissociation_table.py). Energy column = mean electron energy 3/2 Te. Evidence level 4 (docs/EVIDENCE.md).
